{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>ערב</b> — the beginning of the night." "<b>ובקר</b> — the beginning of the day." "<b>וצהרים</b> — midday. And any person can know these times by the sight of his eyes; only at midday he cannot discern it by the shadow, except when it passes, approximately half an hour later."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 55, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:52.989924324Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}